---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — GEO Audit"
  description="Terms and conditions for using the GEO Audit service."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 prose-sm">

    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-8">Last updated: 22 February 2026</p>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">The service</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
        GEO Audit is a free tool that analyses publicly available website data to generate an AI search visibility report. By using the service, you agree to these terms.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">Acceptable use</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-1">
        <li>You may audit any publicly accessible URL</li>
        <li>Do not use the service for automated bulk scanning or scraping</li>
        <li>Do not attempt to overload, exploit, or interfere with the service</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">Audit reports</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
        Reports are generated from publicly available data at the time of the audit. Scores and recommendations are provided as guidance only and may not reflect the full picture of a site's AI search visibility. We make no guarantees about the accuracy, completeness, or timeliness of any report.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">Data retention</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
        Audit reports are accessible via a unique link for 24 hours. We may retain audit data, including the URL submitted and the generated report, for service improvement and business purposes. See our <a href="/privacy" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a> for details.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">Intellectual property</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
        The audit methodology, scoring system, and website content are owned by ProphetFromAI. You may share your own audit reports freely.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
        GEO Audit is provided "as is" without warranty of any kind. We are not liable for any decisions made based on audit results, any loss of traffic or revenue, or any damages arising from use of the service.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">Changes</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
        We may update these terms at any time. Continued use of the service constitutes acceptance of any changes.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
        Questions about these terms? Contact us at <a href="mailto:zachary.gander@prophetfrom.ai" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">zachary.gander@prophetfrom.ai</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
